{
  "id": "0z-oJTZ1b5Q",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 9.24,
      "end": 17.18,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Hey, as far as I'm concerned, this Saturday night there's not even going to be a fight.",
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 14.71
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm going to mercy kill this old man.",
          "start": 14.75,
          "end": 17.18
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "as far as I'm concerned",
          "ko": "내가 보기엔, 내 생각엔",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "mercy kill",
          "ko": "고통 없이 끝장내다, 안락사시키다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 17.22,
      "end": 26.23,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Derek is very good person, but soon he will learn manners.",
          "start": 17.22,
          "end": 21.19
        },
        {
          "text": "I will torture his body so that he so learns to be humble.",
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 26.23
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "learn manners",
          "ko": "예의를 배우다",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "humble",
          "ko": "겸손한",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 26.76,
      "end": 32.63,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I'm going to dance around him while he's trying to hit me with his cane.",
          "start": 26.76,
          "end": 30.6
        },
        {
          "text": "Old man.",
          "start": 30.63,
          "end": 32.63
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "cane",
          "ko": "지팡이",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 32.67,
      "end": 39.81,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "God chose me for this fight. God is the teacher.",
          "start": 32.67,
          "end": 36.1
        },
        {
          "text": "Derek is the student, and I am God's instrument.",
          "start": 36.7,
          "end": 39.81
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "God's instrument",
          "ko": "신의 도구",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 41.47,
      "end": 51.75,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "When I squeeze your lungs, Derek, and you beg me for life, then your heart will open up to the Lord.",
          "start": 41.47,
          "end": 48.48
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm going to knock him out round one, bitch.",
          "start": 49.48,
          "end": 51.75
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "beg me for life",
          "ko": "살려달라고 내게 빌다",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "open up to",
          "ko": "~에게 마음을 열다",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "knock him out",
          "ko": "(권투) 그를 KO시키다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 52.55,
      "end": 61.26,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Wait, what did he say again? He said God chose him.",
          "start": 52.55,
          "end": 57.22
        },
        {
          "text": "That doesn't even make sense really.",
          "start": 58.62,
          "end": 61.26
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "doesn't make sense",
          "ko": "말이 안 된다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 62.43,
      "end": 81.21,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "When you eat through plastic tube, when you are paralyzed from neck down, then your family will gather around your hospital bed to see the new Derek.",
          "start": 62.43,
          "end": 76.34
        },
        {
          "text": "Okay, he know we just talking here, right?",
          "start": 78.54,
          "end": 81.21
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "paralyzed from the neck down",
          "ko": "목 아래로 마비된",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 81.25,
      "end": 89.19,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I mean, we just getting people interested in the fight.",
          "start": 81.25,
          "end": 85.55
        },
        {
          "text": "Because I'm sorry. Is this [bleep] crazy?",
          "start": 85.58,
          "end": 89.19
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "get people interested",
          "ko": "사람들의 관심을 끌다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 89.22,
      "end": 99.47,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "God's lessons are so beautiful.",
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 93.16
        },
        {
          "text": "God's lessons are beautiful. I'm sorry.",
          "start": 97.4,
          "end": 99.47
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 99.5,
      "end": 109.48,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Who put this fight together? This is a ...",
          "start": 99.5,
          "end": 102.5
        },
        {
          "text": "Well, if y'all got a actual crazy person for me to fight, well, that's not fair to me or him.",
          "start": 102.54,
          "end": 109.48
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "put this fight together",
          "ko": "이 시합을 성사시키다, 짜다",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "that's not fair to",
          "ko": "~에게 공정하지 않다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 123.49,
      "end": 128.76,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "What you mean you can't find him?",
          "start": 123.49,
          "end": 125.26
        },
        {
          "text": "Well, where is he? Yo, man, where my manager at?",
          "start": 125.82,
          "end": 128.76
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 128.79,
      "end": 138.51,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Steve, how's that-",
          "start": 128.79,
          "end": 138.51
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
